body:
Lead: #4, #6, #7 and #8 are merged and ready for your verification. Main is at f3e624a, nothing pushed. The suite passes: CPython 156 tests (34 hou-only skipped), hython 156 OK.
- Reviews: all four approved, minor findings only. I fixed #7's two nits myself (ebd0648): .p3d stripping belongs to the Proxy node, and a note that Buoyancy/PhysX mass rules come from D14 rather than A3OB.
- #8 minors not fixed yet:
  - import doesn't warn on 0-2-sided faces â†’ folded into #12;
  - no re-read on file mtime (only path change or the Reload button);
  - selections containing proxy points create empty or partial mesh groups, with the members kept inside the proxy's embedded groups. M4 must rebuild those selections from both places.
- Small change on main (f3e624a): nodes.KINDS now discovers node modules by itself, so parallel node tasks don't conflict.
- Running now, wf_5afa5623-68c, implement then review:
  - #9 Extract LOD + Assemble LODs (pass-through and edit tests);
  - #10 LOD Properties + Material Assign;
  - #11 Mass + Proxy (Proxy must match the importer's proxy form);
  - #12 Selection browser shelf tool + import polish.
That completes M3 per ux-tools Â§9. I'll ping you after the merge.

Lead: M4 is complete. #17 is merged, main is at 80322f5, and nothing is pushed to origin (that's the owner's call). 452 tests pass on CPython and hython. All of #1-#17 are merged.
- #17, verified by rev-17-a in hython:
  - batch convert with Lossless on the fixtures reports "2 identical" and sha256 matches the sources;
  - corrupt or empty .p3d files are reported as failed and the rest still convert;
  - an output folder inside the input folder is refused;
  - with Arma 3 release, the character comes out "different", as expected (lowercase, relative paths, sorting);
  - New P3D builds 11 nodes that cook with no errors;
  - Export Preset+Apply sets all 28 option parameters correctly.
- Filed, not started: #18 post-M4 polish. The starter's Geometry box has quads, so T2-TRI warns (I'll triangulate it or reword ux 7.5), and run_tests.py should take test-name filters.
- Owner items:
  1. GUI clicks of the dialogs: Quick Export, Project root/presets, Selection browser, New P3D, Batch convert, the Save to Disk error dialog.
  2. Do we want the deferred export options (renumber components, Czech names, drop UVs)?
  3. OQ-5/OQ-11 still wait on the Arma 3 Samples files (D6).
  4. Pushing main to GitHub.
  5. The D3 FX/Apprentice loading check before any public release.
I'll start #18 on your word, or on whatever the owner prioritises next.
